                <pb facs="0526" n="518" sameAs="frus:frus1941v07/pg518"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">823.248/251: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Ambassador in Peru</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Norweb</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-10-23T19:00:00-05:00">October 23, 1941—7
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>417. Your 566, October 22, 8 p.m. Your suggestions are being very carefully
                    studied on an urgent basis, and it is hoped that something can be worked out in
                    time to permit of an announcement during the course of Larco Herrera’s visit to
                    Washington. In the meantime, of course, no commitment can be made.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
